'''Volley Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]] that can be obtained when beating the stage [[The Wormhole Opens (Deadly)|The 2nd Dimension]] appearing every Sunday. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.7 Update|Version 8.7]] increases health and gains the ability to slow [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemies.

