==Trivia==
*Volley Cat's evolutions play off of how ''volley'', ''ballet'' and ''curry'' all have very similar spellings and pronunciations in Japanese (バレー ''barē'', バレエ ''baree'' and カレー ''karē'', respectively).
*Volley Cat being known as the "Witch of the Municipal Gymnasium" (市営体育館の魔女 ''Shiei Taiikukan no Majo'') in her Japanese description may reference [[wikipedia:Oriental Witches|Oriental Witches]] (東洋の魔女, ''Tōyō no Majo''), a famous nickname for the women's volleyball team Nichibo Kaizuka.
*The number '2' on Volley Cat's uniform is there because 2 is pronounced ''ni'' in Japanese, which sounds similar to ''nyan'', the onomatopoeia for a cat's meow.
*The move Ballet Cat does in her attack animation is known as a "Grand jeté".

